WEBVTT

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.360
Hello, I'm Kurata Ami.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.620
It's already been one month since I began cycling.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.370
These days, I go riding with everyone whenever I'm free.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.120
And I just bought my cycling shorts and skirt!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.320
It feels great!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.740
What's wrong?

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.540
This is a little too skin tight, isn't it?

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.760
I'm worried my body line will show...

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.910
There's something called a cycling skirt
just for people like you-paca!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.770
Cycling skirts?

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.850
Okay, please ring this up too.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:56.510
With that, your total is 18,775 yen-paca.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.210
Huh? That much?!

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.850
It was expensive, but...

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.000
Maybe I'm starting to look more like a real cyclist.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.930
Keep going!

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.340
I made it!

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.420
Good job!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:33.610
Way to go.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.690
Good job, Ami.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.150
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:39.700
No, you kept up so well!

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.950
At this rate, it might be fun to challenge a full-fledged mountain pass.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:49.230
Let's see... How about Yabitsu Pass?
It's easily accessible.

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:53.210
Yabitsu... Pass?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:58.110
There's an observatory along the way
with a fantastic view, you'll really enjoy it.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:02.280
And once we get there, we can relax
and enjoy coffee at the cafe on the summit.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.000
I'd love to go there!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.300
You're quite motivated, Ami.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.370
Yes!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:13.280
At this rate, we'll be caught up in no time.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.830
Oh no, that's a little too...

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.640
But if I keep improving...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:25.440
I wonder how much further I can go.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.380
It's so hot today.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:06.700
Ami, make sure to use plenty of sunscreen.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.810
Okay.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.010
Aoi-chan, isn't that hot?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.840
This is a UV protector.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:24.860
It quickly dries your sweat while cycling,
so it's rather refreshing

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.880
Those things are pretty expensive... right?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.120
Well... a little....

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.420
Hey!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.040
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.920
Sorry we're late.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.810
You both biked all the way here again?

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:46.070
Of course!

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.810
By the way, how difficult is today's course, Yabitsu Pass?

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.550
Let's see...

00:04:54.080 --> 00:05:00.220
Well... to be honest, it'll be way tougher
than what we've done so far, so be prepared.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.310
That much?!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:06.580
You can take it slow.
Just don't push yourself too hard.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:11.350
But if you can overcome this,
you might be able to see a whole new world.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:13.960
That's right.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.960
If I can complete Yabitsu Pass...

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.950
I'll be able to ride to many more places.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.930
I'll do my best!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.550
Okay, then let's get going.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.470
It's hot today, so don't forget to keep hydrated.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.230
Yes!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.920
Okay, here we go!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.560
Okay!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.630
I'll do my best!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.020
It's... really... hard.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:05.920
If only it weren't so hot...

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.300
it would be easier...

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.950
It's so hot...

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:19.770
Need a break?

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:25.000
Yeah... My legs are so stiff.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.830
Water, water.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.410
But...

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:39.420
How long does this go on?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.350
We've passed the hardest part.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.670
Yeah? We're almost at the summit then?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.670
More like halfway there, actually.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.180
Really?

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.120
Are you going to be okay?

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.690
Yeah, if I keep getting rest...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.700
Should we get going then?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.560
Yeah.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.190
Okay!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.160
Owww!

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.370
What's wrong?!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.830
I felt this stabbing pain in my leg.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.630
Let's wait around here.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:31.150
I wonder how far Ami-chan and Aoi-chan are?

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:37.390
Your leg is definitely cramped.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.640
Here, you need to stretch your leg out.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:42.680
Oww!

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:43.990
Are you okay?

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.300
How is it?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:54.020
Yeah, it's starting to feel better.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:56.910
No, wait. You should rest a little longer!

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.920
They're rather late.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:07.290
Maybe Ami wasn't ready for Yabitsu yet...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.320
Especially in this heat.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.380
What is it?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.440
Nothing.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.480
Hello?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.600
What? Ami is...?

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.980
The pain's faded.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.200
Can you continue?

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.380
Yeah! I'm sorry I held you back.

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.800
Okay, let's go!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:45.290
Ami!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:48.600
Now, it's both legs...

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.850
Oww! Ow! Owwww!!

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:54.300
At any rate, let's stretch it out again.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.770
Ow! It hurts...

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:02.810
Just when I thought it was better. Why...?

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:08.310
You sweat so much that it caused a sodium deficiency.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.480
Are you okay?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.940
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.570
Here... salt candy.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.700
Thank you.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.840
Come on Ami, stretch out your legs more.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.040
O-Okay...

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:26.960
Oh, it's tasty.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.090
Let's wait until you're feeling better, then call it a day.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:36.220
That's probably a good idea.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.590
No way!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.600
I'm okay! I can continue!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.220
I had the salt candy, so I can move again!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.260
No, stop. It's too soon to move.

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:46.230
No!

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.480
See? I can do it.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.240
Okay then, jump.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.140
Huh? Jump?

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.040
See? I told you so.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.870
It's dangerous to continue like that.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.810
This is as far as we'll go today.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:12.600
Yes.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.740
But...

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:27.740
Sorry about today.
I should have taught you more about replenishment.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:31.020
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.860
It's my fault we couldn't finish.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:38.070
Stopping midway happens all the time in cycling.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.240
Okay...

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.120
Well then, I'll see you on campus.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.150
Later.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.400
Yes, later.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.560
Should we go too?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.810
Aoi-chan... Sorry, can we rest?

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.480
Seems really painful...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.080
I'll go buy some drinks.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.160
Thank you.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.070
Here, Ami.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.130
Cold!

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.540
Sorry.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:50.250
I wonder if Ami got home safely...

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.900
I hope her pain went away.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:57.200
What if she says she doesn't want to go cycling anymore?

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.810
I doubt that.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.450
Yeah.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.750
What is it, Ami?

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:22.360
I failed today...

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:26.640
I guess it means that I still lack a lot of things...

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:31.370
the ability, knowledge, and experience.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.850
But, Aoi-chan...

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.780
I want to keep on riding!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.850
I want to pick up more and more of what I lack...

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:50.030
so I'm able to ride as much as
everyone else as soon as possible!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.600
Ami...

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:59.490
You've changed.
I've never seen you so positive before.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.170
Really?

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:06.930
Darn it! I can't wait to go cycling again!

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:08.930
Ami!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.430
Don't forget to massage your legs when you get home.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.440
Ami's really trying hard these days.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.400
Hold on...

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:32.510
Wouldn't that make her even more likely
to get depressed from today's mishap?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.950
I hope she's not crying alone over it.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:46.450
Maybe I'll invite her to our next family trip to cheer her up.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.350
My legs are so stiff.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.870
Today was rough.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:04.110
My legs have never cramped up like that before.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:09.710
It happens a lot in cycling, huh.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:16.950
I wish I could have reached the end.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.980
Why... am I crying?

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:32.220
You just watch, Yabitsu Pass!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.220
I'll get much, much better...

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:39.100
I'll absolutely get my revenge on you!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.340
Onee-chan, why are you screaming?

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.080
Hey!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.990
Aoi-san's on the phone.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.130
Aoi-chan?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.510
What a great place!

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:10.920
It's been so long since you came with us.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.750
Now that you mention it,
this is the first time since we entered college.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:17.390
Thanks for inviting me today.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.780
No problem, I enjoy being with you too.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.650
But isn't this amazing?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.370
The highest point of the National Highway.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.890
2172 meters?!

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:33.520
It's almost three times higher than Yabitsu!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:35.270
You're right.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.160
That's amazing.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.420
This isn't somewhere you could just ride your bike to, huh?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.660
Look, Aoi-chan! She's incredible!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.230
Yabitsu Pass was tough enough, yet...

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.610
She's coming this way!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.580
I wonder if she heard us talking about her?

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:13.570
Calm down. It's not like we said anything bad.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:25.330
Excuse me, can you take a picture for me?

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.680
Wasn't she amazing?

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:35.500
She biked all the way to somewhere like this!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.100
She really was.

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:41.380
Hinako-san and Yayoi-san ride similar bikes.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.980
You have one too, right, Aoi-chan?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.090
Yeah, they're called road bik-

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:46.730
Wha-!

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:58.960
Look, Aoi-chan! He's so friendly!

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.280
So cute!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.050
Good boy!

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:07.330
Oh, his name's Indy-kun.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.480
Look how fluffy he is, Aoi-chan!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.710
That's okay. You know me and dogs...

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:18.220
Oh, yeah... You're afraid of dogs.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.880
Are you okay?

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.970
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.130
You're so cute.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.350
H-Hey...

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.360
Hey wait!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.940
No, you're being too rough!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.360
Don't pull!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:35.860
Ami!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.290
Let go!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.100
Hey, Indy-kun!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.880
This way.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.480
Over here!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:54.630
Good boy!

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:58.260
I'm saved...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.600
I'm sorry I wasn't any help.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:03.650
I got him too excited.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:06.600
He loves fluffy things.

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:10.910
He'll eye anything like that.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:18.580
I'm sorry! You got so beat up, I couldn't help but...

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.800
Oh, you're that...

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.690
Bye-bye!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.790
Oh, you're the girl who took my picture!

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.730
Thanks for that!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:31.640
No problem. Thank you for coming to my rescue.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:37.590
Both Hinako-san and Yayoi-san, and Aoi-chan too...

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.740
Thank you so much.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.740
Oh, no problem.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:43.100
It seems like all the great riders use road bikes.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.670
What is it? Are you interested in my bicycle?

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.390
Oh, I...

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.470
She started cycling recently.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.000
Really? A fellow cyclist?

00:18:56.730 --> 00:19:01.090
Is a road bike different from other bicycles?

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:05.660
She rides a folding bike.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.390
Oh, then it's probably way different.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.770
Really?

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.440
Why don't you see for yourself?

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.210
Try lifting it.

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.250
Can I?

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.550
Of course.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.650
Okay, then...

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.680
Excuse me...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.650
Amazing, huh?

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.510
It's huge, yet...

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:38.300
It's definitely lighter than Ponta-kun, isn't it?

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.570
I bet it's much lighter.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:45.580
You'll probably understand if you try it,
but going uphill feels completely different.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:59.260
Thanks to this, I can comfortably ride up a hill.

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.560
Is that so?

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:04.010
And it's not only the lightness.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:09.140
As fast and comfortable as possible...
Road bikes are made with that in mind.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.360
I see...

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:16.800
In places like this, there's nothing like a road bike.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.240
How is it? Caught your interest?

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.610
Yes!

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:26.660
Oh, but I have Ponta-kun, so...

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.990
Ponta-kun?

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:32.260
Ami's... It's her folding bicycle.

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:34.370
I see.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.560
But if you're interested,

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.200
I think it's fine to take the leap and buy a road bike.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.970
But they're super expensive, right?

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:46.200
Well, it's not an easy purchase to make, that's for sure.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:49.010
But once you get your hands on a road bike,

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.520
you might be able to see a brand new world.

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:00.860
Oh, look at the time!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.530
I hope I see you again somewhere.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.600
Yes!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.600
Take care.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.330
Yeah, thanks!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.420
Later, then!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.200
She was... quite an amazing person...

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.300
Yeah...

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:29.310
A brand new world...

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.620
A road bike...

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:46.220
Bicycles...

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:48.960
are so much fun!

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:54.230
Yeah...

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:32.800
A road bike, huh...

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:37.170
There's so much to bikes!
My world is ballooning!

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:40.060
But, but... my wallet's completely empty!

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:44.460
Next time on Long Riders:
"A Secret Part-time Job!"
